     "title": "Three states",
     "md": "**Matter** is anything that takes up space and has mass. It can be a **solid** (keeps its shape: stone, book), a **liquid** (flows and takes the shape of its container: water, oil, milk) or a **gas** (spreads to fill its container: air, steam). We cannot see most gases, but we feel moving air as wind."
